      "text": "4. SQLite Engine (mint.db + schema.sql)\n• Tables: users, accounts, transactions, budgets\n• UNIQUE(account_id, external_id) -> Idempotent\n• UNIQUE(user_id, category) -> Upsert Budget\n• INDEX(user_id, created_at) -> Fast Monthly Sum",
